          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.452,
          "end": 94.452,
          "en": "to compose your overall application from those components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.84,
          "end": 97.53,
          "en": "Hence, we wanna to add a regular react component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 101.60300000000001,
          "en": "and the question now is where do we store such a component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.61,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "That is generally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 108.52000000000001,
          "en": "but it should not be in the pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.52000000000001,
          "end": 112.446,
          "en": "In the pages folder, you should only have page components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.446,
          "end": 115.82,
          "en": "because whichever files you create in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.82,
          "end": 118.41,
          "en": "those files will then automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.41,
          "end": 121.24,
          "en": "lead to routs being generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.24,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "So, next JS will pick up any files stored in pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 127.97,
          "en": "and generate routs for them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.97,
          "end": 131.47,
          "en": "and for the regular components we don't want that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.47,
          "end": 135.54,
          "en": "A list component here should not be reachable through a rout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.54,
          "end": 138.85,
          "en": "instead I wanna use it in the JSX code of some other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.85,
          "end": 142.81,
          "en": "component of this homepage component for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.81,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "And therefore you don't store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.9,
          "end": 147.684,
          "en": "regular components in the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.684,
          "end": 150.32,
          "en": "but instead we create a brand new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.32,
          "end": 153.09,
          "en": "for example, one named components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.46,
